        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">crystallite with rotated cube texture orientation</rdfs:label>
        <skos:comment xml:lang="en">Note: this class is  not intended to be asserted, but inferred based on the grain orientation relative to the rolling reference frame. It is a part of the macroscopic texture inference.</skos:comment>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">crystallite with rotated cube texture orientation is a crystallite whose family of &lt;110&gt; equivalent directions in a cubic lattice system are oriented approximately parallel to the rolling direction and family of {001} equivalent directions are oriented approximately parallel to the rolling plane.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


